         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nWe already know one comparison: equality (=). Two things are equal when a change on one side is matched by the same change on the other.\n\nNow we add two more: greater and smaller.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "11d4f426-bf84-40b8-acb8-a0f61e47a778",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "11d4f426-bf84-40b8-acb8-a0f61e47a778",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "inlove",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "0fe4b20d-1bd5-4f36-9d0b-87c10881ff8d",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=0fe4b20d-1bd5-4f36-9d0b-87c10881ff8d",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### A Ruler\n\nA ruler is a strip with marks. The long marks show 0, 10, 20 … up to 100. The short marks show the values in between.\n\nLook closely: every mark is the same distance from the next.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "A centesimal scale, that is, a ruler with marks from 0 to 100.",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<img src=\"https://www.historytracers.org/images/HistoryTracers/Meter.jpg\" class=\"imgcenter\"/>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "A centesimal scale, that is, a ruler with marks from 0 to 100.",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "*Figure 1: A centesimal scale. The long marks carry the tens, and the shorter marks stand for the values in between.*",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "cee40b13-4bcb-4524-a6e4-69cb70a43a9b",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
